  "releaseNotes": "Makes no-options AddOllamaSpeech() the primary documented setup: local Ollama at http://localhost:11434/, phonon model, default voice, and WAV output. CLI defaults now come from library options. Adds regression coverage for omitted, null, and empty options and default requests in complete/streaming modes. Updates runnable samples and blog. URL normalization and explicit overrides remain supported. Apple Silicon/MLX server requirements and pending live-audio verification are unchanged.",
